{"seq":3,"slug":"trained-classifiers","title":"训练式检测器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-content-detection-watermarking/detection/trained-classifiers","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"训练式检测器\">训练式检测器</h1><p>零样本检测器在学术榜单上漂亮，但教育机构、出版社、招聘平台真正掏钱买的几乎都是另一类东西：把一个预训练编码器在「人类 vs 机器」标注语料上微调出来的二分类器，外加 GPTZero、Originality.ai、Copyleaks 这样的商用封装。它们准确率宣称惊人、调用一行 API、给出一个红绿进度条。这一篇讲清这类检测器怎么训练、为什么在厂商基准上近乎完美、又为什么在真实世界里——尤其对非母语写作者——会造成系统性冤枉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-监督微调的基本形态\">核心概念：监督微调的基本形态</h2><p>最经典的训练式检测器是 OpenAI 早年发布的 RoBERTa-based GPT-2 detector：拿大量人类文本与 GPT-2 输出，给编码器接一个分类头，用交叉熵优化</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">[</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{j=1}^{N}\\Big[y_j\\log \\hat{p}_j + (1-y_j)\\log(1-\\hat{p}_j)\\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2421em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_j\\in\\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 是「机器/人类」标签，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是模型预测的机器概率。和零样本方法相比，它的优势是不需要在推理时访问生成模型的 logits（只需文本本身），且在与训练数据同分布的场景下准确率很高。</p>\n<p>代价是它继承了一切监督学习的脆弱性：<strong>分布外即失效</strong>。在 GPT-2 文本上训练的检测器面对 GPT-4、Claude、Gemini 的输出常常大幅退化，因为新模型的统计指纹与训练标签早已不同。商用产品靠不断重训追赶新模型，但这是一场永远落后半步的军备�竞赛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"商用检测器的真实表现\">商用检测器的真实表现</h2><p>把厂商基准与独立测试摆在一起，落差触目惊心。下表汇总 2025–2026 年的公开数据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>厂商自报（GPTZero 2026 内测）</th>\n<th>独立测试观察</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准确率</td>\n<td>约 99.4%</td>\n<td>原始 AI 文本约 88–95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假阳性率</td>\n<td>宣称 0.00%</td>\n<td>人类写作误判约 18%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非母语（ESL）误判</td>\n<td>宣称已去偏至约 1%</td>\n<td>独立研究中高达约 61%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗 humanizer</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>重度改写后准确率跌到约 60–80%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些数字来自对 GPTZero、Originality、Copyleaks 的公开评测与斯坦福关于 ESL 误判的研究。关键不是「某家产品差」，而是一个结构性事实：厂商在自己挑选的同分布测试集上报告近乎完美，而在真实多样、含改写、含非母语样本的场景里表现腰斩。Yale、Berkeley 等多所高校在 2025–2026 年陆续停用此类检测器作为处罚依据，正是对这种落差的制度回应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"esl-误判的机理与代价\">ESL 误判的机理与代价</h2><p>为什么非母语写作者被系统性误判？根源在 <a href=\"statistical-detection\">统计与困惑度检测</a> 里讲过的似然信号：训练式检测器虽然不显式算困惑度，但它从标注里学到的判别特征高度相关于「文本是否流畅、低意外」。非母语写作者倾向使用更高频、更安全的词汇与句式，文本困惑度天然偏低，于是被模型当成机器指纹。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[非母语写作者] --&gt; B[偏好高频安全词汇]&#10;  B --&gt; C[文本困惑度偏低]&#10;  C --&gt; D[落入机器特征区]&#10;  D --&gt; E[被判 AI 生成]&#10;  E --&gt; F[处罚或污名]&#10;  G[流畅母语写手] --&gt; C&#10;  H[改写后的机器文本] --&gt; I[注入罕见词与波动]&#10;  I --&gt; J[困惑度升高]&#10;  J --&gt; K[被判人类]&#10;  K --&gt; L[漏检]\">flowchart TD\n  A[非母语写作者] --&gt; B[偏好高频安全词汇]\n  B --&gt; C[文本困惑度偏低]\n  C --&gt; D[落入机器特征区]\n  D --&gt; E[被判 AI 生成]\n  E --&gt; F[处罚或污名]\n  G[流畅母语写手] --&gt; C\n  H[改写后的机器文本] --&gt; I[注入罕见词与波动]\n  I --&gt; J[困惑度升高]\n  J --&gt; K[被判人类]\n  K --&gt; L[漏检]</pre><p>这张图同时揭示了两类相反的错误：真人（非母语者、技术写手）被误判，而蓄意改写过的机器文本反而逃脱。两类错误叠加，使训练式检测器在「需要据其处罚」的场景里几乎不可用——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-detection\">为何需要检测与溯源</a> 里那个后验概率计算的现实版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎样负责任地使用训练式检测器\">怎样负责任地使用训练式检测器</h2><p>承认局限不等于全盘否定。训练式检测器在某些场景仍有正当用途，关键是把它放在「软信号」而非「硬判据」的位置。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>批量初筛而非个体定罪</strong>：用于在海量内容里圈出可疑子集做人工复核，而不是直接对单个个体下处罚结论。</li>\n<li><strong>公布并校准阈值</strong>：明确报告所用阈值对应的假阳性率，对低基础发生率场景调高阈值，宁可多漏不可多冤。</li>\n<li><strong>多证据交叉</strong>：与写作过程记录、版本历史、面谈等过程性证据结合，绝不单凭一个概率分。</li>\n<li><strong>对 ESL 与领域文本单独评估</strong>：在部署前用本机构真实人群的样本测假阳性率，而非信任厂商基准。</li>\n<li><strong>优先改造评估方式</strong>：在生成方不配合、对手会改写的场景（教育是典型），更稳的做法是改成口头答辩、过程提交，把对抗博弈从检测器移走。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些原则与 <a href=\"../practice/detection-policy\">政策与落地</a> 里的部署建议一脉相承，也呼应护栏 hub 对「检测器要带可解释证据」的要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>训练式检测器把预训练编码器在「人类 vs 机器」标注上微调，推理时只需文本、不需 logits，同分布下准确率高。</li>\n<li>它的根本脆弱是分布外失效：在旧模型上训练的检测器对新模型大幅退化，靠重训追赶永远落后半步。</li>\n<li>厂商在同分布基准报告近乎完美，但独立测试显示人类误判约 18%、ESL 误判最高约 61%、重度改写后准确率腰斩。</li>\n<li>ESL 误判源于「低困惑度=流畅」被当成机器指纹；负责任用法是把它当软初筛而非硬处罚依据，并优先改造评估方式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>误判的统计根源：<a href=\"statistical-detection\">统计与困惑度检测</a></li>\n<li>免标注的另一条路：<a href=\"zero-shot-detectors\">零样本检测</a></li>\n<li>误判代价的后验计算：<a href=\"../foundations/why-detection\">为何需要检测与溯源</a></li>\n<li>公平性与偏见的系统视角：<a href=\"../../ai-safety-alignment/fairness-and-bias/fairness-metrics\">公平性指标</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"训练式检测器","id":"训练式检测器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：监督微调的基本形态","id":"核心概念-监督微调的基本形态"},{"level":2,"text":"商用检测器的真实表现","id":"商用检测器的真实表现"},{"level":2,"text":"ESL 误判的机理与代价","id":"esl-误判的机理与代价"},{"level":2,"text":"怎样负责任地使用训练式检测器","id":"怎样负责任地使用训练式检测器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"零样本检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-content-detection-watermarking/detection/zero-shot-detectors"},"next":{"title":"LLM 文本水印","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-content-detection-watermarking/watermarking/llm-watermarking"}}